    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herding Ain\u2019t Easy, It's Chaotic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your herd is clueless, clumsy, and constantly in danger, but it\u2019s up to you to get them to their destination! In <i>The Herd</i>, you\u2019ll guide a stampede of not-so-bright animals through a world filled with <strong>ridiculous hazards, sneaky predators, and total mayhem.</strong> Use a variety of wacky tools to steer them clear of danger, or just embrace the chaos and see what happens!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herd Wranglin' Gadgets:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch Pad</strong>: Some herd members need a little \u201cmotivation.\u201d Fling them across obstacles and take control of their fate, whether they like it or not!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong>: Your animals might not be bright, but this fire sure is, and the herd will tend to avoid it. Use it to steer them in the right direction (or just wreak havoc on the environment and watch the ensuing chaos).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall</strong>: Herd bouncing off in all directions? Plop down a wall to rebound them into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fan</strong>: Need a little extra push? Give your herd a gusty nudge with a well placed fan.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fence</strong>: Solid objects are scary. Block the wrong paths and funnel your herd where you actually want them to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog</strong>: Nothing clears a crowd like a barking dog! Use these feisty puppers to spook your herd into moving in the right direction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herding Ain\u2019t Easy, It's Chaotic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your herd is clueless, clumsy, and constantly in danger, but it\u2019s up to you to get them to their destination! In <i>The Herd</i>, you\u2019ll guide a stampede of not-so-bright animals through a world filled with <strong>ridiculous hazards, sneaky predators, and total mayhem.</strong> Use a variety of wacky tools to steer them clear of danger, or just embrace the chaos and see what happens!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Herd Wranglin' Gadgets:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch Pad</strong>: Some herd members need a little \u201cmotivation.\u201d Fling them across obstacles and take control of their fate, whether they like it or not!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/b4d064a8df9001955bb33f1a402ecb2a.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire</strong>: Your animals might not be bright, but this fire sure is, and the herd will tend to avoid it. Use it to steer them in the right direction (or just wreak havoc on the environment and watch the ensuing chaos).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/06532de26f3812fb3f37ac71ff8fc26d.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall</strong>: Herd bouncing off in all directions? Plop down a wall to rebound them into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/ebb840823d82080d73c5ac741dd7340e.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fan</strong>: Need a little extra push? Give your herd a gusty nudge with a well placed fan.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/46e2b7947c99b56c4c9c4f8dfc5a792a.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fence</strong>: Solid objects are scary. Block the wrong paths and funnel your herd where you actually want them to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dog</strong>: Nothing clears a crowd like a barking dog! Use these feisty puppers to spook your herd into moving in the right direction.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.poster.avif?t=1754486879\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.webm?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/aff49bb2dbff6bc3861e365fb5489d5e.mp4?t=1754486879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
